# === privgas-v2 .gitignore ===
# See docs/baseline-spec.md and docs/experiment-schema.md for why these
# boundaries exist. When in doubt, keep raw/private data OUT of git.

# --- Private data: NEVER commit -------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/private/ is treated as sensitive by default
# (e.g. real keys, unredacted logs, participant data, anything not cleared
# for publication). Only the placeholder files below are allowed through.
data/private/**
!data/private/.gitkeep
!data/private/README.md

# --- Generated / local-only outputs ----------------------------------------
# Raw experiment dumps and result artifacts are reproducible from
# experiments/ + a recorded seed (docs/experiment-schema.md) and should not
# bloat the repo. Keep the directory structure via .gitkeep.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
results/*
!results/.gitkeep
figures/*
!figures/.gitkeep
*.log
env-report-*.txt

# --- Generated public run data (policy changed 2026-09-14) -----------------
# Recorder output under data/public/ is regenerable from data/raw/ + the
# private seed (docs/experiment-schema.md), so generated runs are ignored by
# default, exactly like data/raw/ and results/. A generated run is published
# only by an explicit, reviewed decision (and never before
# `make recorder-selfcheck` passes) -- not by a stray `git add -A`.
# Still committable: the placeholder files, and the tiny SYNTHETIC recorder
# examples (`*-example/`, run_id prefixed `synthetic-`) that document the
# schema. Schema definitions and fixture generators live under experiments/
# and are unaffected.
data/public/**
!data/public/.gitkeep
!data/public/README.md
!data/public/baselines/
!data/public/baselines/*-example/
!data/public/baselines/*-example/**
# Foundry build output of the W1 baselines (the generic out/ and cache/
# patterns below already cover it; listed for clarity).
baselines/w1_b0_b2/out/
baselines/w1_b0_b2/cache/

# --- Secrets / environment --------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# --- Language / tooling artifacts ------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# Foundry / Hardhat (if contracts/ tooling is added later)
out/
cache/
artifacts/
typechain/
typechain-types/
broadcast/

# Circuit build outputs (if circuits/ tooling is added later)
*.r1cs
*.wasm
*.zkey
*.ptau

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
